cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproducibility package, please cite as below."
title: "Governing AI for Climate Action: Cross-National Evidence from Digital-Climate Policy Alignment Gaps"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/seungjin-data/DCAI"
abstract: >
  Reproducibility package for the manuscript "Governing AI for Climate Action:
  Cross-National Evidence from Digital-Climate Policy Alignment Gaps",
  submitted to npj Climate Action (Springer Nature).
  Measures policy-document alignment between national AI strategies and
  climate-energy governance documents across 75 countries using the
  AI Capacity Institutionalisation (ACI) index and Climate-Energy
  Integration Score (CEIS). Submission ID: baaefced-0bbb-4a9c-a9b3-2ae230158e7b.
